steamid": "76561197963535404", "personaname": "P4ds", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/apqaqdock/", "num_games_owned": 911, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 87726, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 13364, "last_played": 1788883617, "avatar": "9f37aeb8a2786c3c91ece677fad39430d29cc96c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great sim, has some of its old ArmA problems like stairs and stuff but still, nothing competes  with it for sheer scale!", "timestamp_created": 1439673936, "timestamp_updated": 1439673936, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "17556567", "author": {"steamid": "76561198067976902", "personaname": "SergeantShavedBalls", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/snowskijunky/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 30, "playtime_forever": 149426, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 136463, "last_played": 1674875995, "avatar": "cb5932cf06f6e51eaaf12cae6f352b7124a5bc9a"}, "language": "english", "review": "All I can say after playing nearly 1400 hours is that the community on this game sucks.\n\nSingle player is beautiful and there are a wealth of things to do with mods, but expect to deal with ridiculous ban-happy admins in almost every multiplayer server, on the god aweful bohemia interactive forums, and on armaholic. Don't plan on playing any roleplaying servers without constantly dealing with people who dont roleplay or admins that abuse their powers. The best bet is to find a group of good people to play with, which is next to impossible. \n\nThe game itself, while beautiful and expansive, is not well optimized at all. It barely uses my four core cpu, and I get just the same FPS with my hd7850 as those who run the game on a gtx 980ti.\n\nAlso, I should note that you might as well buy the dlc unless you want to be bombarded with stupid dlc advertisements the entire time you play. Oh, and the dlc is stupid because there are a ♥♥♥♥-ton of mods out there that add even better weapons and vehicles (assuming you don't get IP banned from armaholic for no reason).\n\nNote to self and others: Don't play in any public servers after or during a sale...the number of children and tkers is extremely high.\n\nUPDATE: Teamkilling on official servers is an excessive issue. Every time I've attempted to bring it to Bohemia's attention, I have been met with resistance. I've been banned on the steam discussion page and am probably close to being banned on their forums. Why, Bohemia, do you not care about your game???????? Its been 5 years and nothing has been done.", "timestamp_created": 1439671369, "timestamp_updated": 1674870375, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.580506801605224609", "comment_count": 20, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "17556463", "author": {"steamid": "76561198146200457", "personaname": "Roy23", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198146200457/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 4190, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 490, "last_played": 1584619599, "avatar": "8dfe278c7493b6984540e57ecd57b791df13841e"}, "language": "english", "review": "game executable not found. please repair your game using the steam client", "timestamp_created": 1439670856, "timestamp_updated": 1439670919, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false